{
  "name": "IT Infrastructure AI Agent",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "public": true,
        "initialMessages": "Welcome to IT Infrastructure Assistant! I can help you with:\n\n• Server & SSH management\n• Cloud operations (AWS S3, etc.)\n• Database administration (MySQL, PostgreSQL)\n• GitHub repository management\n• Jira ticket handling\n• Monitoring & alerts (Grafana, PagerDuty)\n• Slack notifications\n• And much more!\n\nWhat can I help you with today?",
        "options": {
          "allowFileUploads": false,
          "showWelcomeScreen": true,
          "getStarted": "Start Managing Infrastructure",
          "subtitle": "Your AI-powered DevOps & SRE companion",
          "title": "IT Infrastructure Assistant",
          "responseMode": "streaming"
        }
      },
      "id": "4ac836ac-bce5-4c8b-8958-fee6fa8ebd1d",
      "name": "IT Infrastructure Chat",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chatTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        480,
        592
      ],
      "webhookId": "812d815c-4be2-4b45-aed3-d4ef8e692b9c"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an expert IT Infrastructure and DevOps assistant with deep knowledge of:\n\n• Server Administration: SSH access, system monitoring, log analysis, service management\n• Database Management: MySQL, PostgreSQL queries, backups, performance tuning\n• Cloud Operations: AWS S3 storage, resource management, cost optimization\n• Version Control: GitHub repository management, issue tracking, code reviews\n• Project Management: Jira ticket creation, sprint planning, workflow automation\n• Communication: Slack notifications, team alerts, status updates\n• Incident Response: PagerDuty incident creation, escalation, on-call management\n• Monitoring: Grafana dashboard analysis, metrics interpretation, alerting\n• API Integration: HTTP requests to any REST API, webhook handling\n• Automation: Custom scripting, data transformation, calculations\n\nAVAILABLE TOOLS:\n1. SSH Command Executor - Run shell commands on servers\n2. MySQL Database - Execute SQL queries on MySQL\n3. PostgreSQL Database - Execute SQL queries on PostgreSQL\n4. AWS S3 Storage - Upload/manage files in S3 buckets\n5. GitHub Repository Manager - Create issues, manage repos\n6. Jira Ticket Manager - Create and manage Jira tickets\n7. Slack Messenger - Send messages to Slack channels\n8. PagerDuty Incident Manager - Create and manage incidents\n9. Grafana Dashboard Viewer - Retrieve dashboard data\n10. HTTP API Client - Make requests to any API\n11. Custom Code Executor - Run JavaScript for complex tasks\n12. Calculator - Perform mathematical calculations\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n• Always confirm destructive operations before executing\n• Provide clear explanations of what each tool does\n• Use appropriate tools based on the task requirements\n• Format responses clearly with proper structure\n• Include relevant details like command outputs, query results, or API responses\n• Suggest best practices and security considerations\n• When credentials are needed, guide users to configure them in n8n\n\nBe helpful, accurate, and security-conscious in all operations.",
          "maxIterations": 15,
          "returnIntermediateSteps": false
        }
      },
